NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers ONLY the original code in this repository: the halftone
lattice renderer, the interface, and the data plumbing.

It does NOT cover, and cannot relicense:

  * Map data        © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0
  * Vector tiles    OpenFreeMap (Zsolt Ero), OpenMapTiles schema
  * MapLibre GL JS  BSD-3-Clause, vendored in vendor/
  * Geocoding       Nominatim, OpenStreetMap Foundation, ODbL
  * Statistics      World Bank Open Data, CC BY 4.0
  * Datasets        Wikidata, CC0 1.0
  * Colour schemes  ColorBrewer, Cynthia Brewer & Mark Harrower, Apache 2.0
  * Typefaces       Dotwork / Space Mono / Space Grotesk, SIL OFL 1.1

Each of those remains under its own licence and belongs to its own authors.
See CREDITS.md for the full attribution.

This is a personal experiment built for fun with Claude Code. It is not
affiliated with or endorsed by any of the projects above, and takes nothing
away from them.
